  ('1c9db242-0151-5a65-9f7b-981341198341', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g5-word-parts'), null, 'hard',
   $q$The Greek parts auto ("self"), bio ("life"), and graph ("write") make up the word "autobiography." What had Grandpa Teo started writing?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A list of every place he had ever visited","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-geography"},{"text":"The story of his own life, written by himself","is_correct":true},{"text":"The story of someone else's life, written by him","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-biography"},{"text":"A collection of made-up stories about boats","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-bio-root"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The story of his own life, written by himself$q$, $q$Autobiography means "self life writing," a person's own life story told by that person. Without auto, the word is biography, a life story about someone else, like the project Mei wrote about her grandpa.$q$, 'draft', 'f72347d9-a04c-5ee8-ad9b-7cce5b614929')
